# reboot restarts the machine (INV-0155-7, INV-0159-2, ADR-0159): with
# run-qemu.sh --reboot a reset starts the guest again instead of ending
# QEMU, so the boot and the shell come a second time; poweroff ends it.
! panicked
! first process ended
! not supported
